                "formula": "$gv(sum_tx) + gv(day_secs) * (if(tc(json, gv(tmp_day), \".items[72].stats.b[0]\") != \"\", mu(max, 0, tc(json, gv(tmp_day), \".items[72].stats.b[0]\")), mu(max, 0, tc(json, gv(tmp_day), \".items[72].stats.ns\") + 0) * 1048576))$"
